(5483287, 790742, 96881, '<td valign="top">And you are also being different with the presentation of your motivational poster........No black border or comforming for you.........<br/> <br/>The writing is difficult to read.  I am not sure where you got the colour from, as it doesn''t appear in the photo.  I would have probably gone iwth the blue from the pencils......<br/> <br/>The flash reflections are a problem, the background woodgrain is a distraction in this.........and the hand just doesn''t seem to work for me</td>', 'And you are also being different with the presentation of your motivational poster........No black border or comforming for you......... The writing is difficult to read.  I am not sure where you got the colour from, as it doesn''t appear in the photo.  I would have probably gone iwth the blue from the pencils...... The flash reflections are a problem, the background woodgrain is a distraction in this.........and the hand just doesn''t seem to work for me', '2009-05-13 02:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483294, 789250, 96881, '<td valign="top">I will be fussy.......your writing should have been capitalised correctly.  I noticed straight away that Perfect is the only word in Title case.  In Nature, Nothing is Perfect yet Everything is Perfect........yes, being fussy on this challenge......<br/> <br/>Ok, Photo.........Stunning.  Love the colours in the bug.  The blues are just brilliant.  The composition is good, the depth of field is perfect.......The Photo fits with the phase exactly.....Its a great shot.<br/> <br/>I note you didn''t go with the normal Black background which is good, nor did you go with the standard poster crop.<br/> <br/>A really good submission for this.......Hey, i had to be picky to find something to comment on.....a good score from me for that stunning photo</td>', 'I will be fussy.......your writing should have been capitalised correctly.  I noticed straight away that Perfect is the only word in Title case.  In Nature, Nothing is Perfect yet Everything is Perfect........yes, being fussy on this challenge...... Ok, Photo.........Stunning.  Love the colours in the bug.  The blues are just brilliant.  The composition is good, the depth of field is perfect.......The Photo fits with the phase exactly.....Its a great shot. I note you didn''t go with the normal Black background which is good, nor did you go with the standard poster crop. A really good submission for this.......Hey, i had to be picky to find something to comment on.....a good score from me for that stunning photo', '2009-05-13 02:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
