(5483390, 790693, 96881, '<td valign="top">That it does.....<br/> <br/>Like the picture.  Shutter speed was spot on to get the blur but still seperate blades on the mian rotor, the full circle on the tail rotor, and keeping the chopper still sharp.  I like the use of the blue in the border in traditional poster form.  A great poster</td>', 'That it does..... Like the picture.  Shutter speed was spot on to get the blur but still seperate blades on the mian rotor, the full circle on the tail rotor, and keeping the chopper still sharp.  I like the use of the blue in the border in traditional poster form.  A great poster', '2009-05-13 03:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483395, 789073, 96881, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really fit the motivational poster, seems more that the photo was taken and the title and phrase made to make it fit.  Format is not in the traditional way and that also doesn''t help here.  Not sure I want my motivational poster telling me to stay busy on my wall at work, I am busy enough.........</td>', 'Doesn''t really fit the motivational poster, seems more that the photo was taken and the title and phrase made to make it fit.  Format is not in the traditional way and that also doesn''t help here.  Not sure I want my motivational poster telling me to stay busy on my wall at work, I am busy enough.........', '2009-05-13 03:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483399, 789987, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great words, and something still worth fighting for.......could sit here on my wall.<br/> <br/>I would have had the writing different, top line ending at the end of the ......., then the second part of the phrase on the second line.  You could afford to shrink the writing to make it work.......Title could have been more bold as well, and the border also I feel should be thicker....<br/> <br/>Don''t know what the photo is of, I presume somewhere where the flags of nations fly.  I like the different idea of showing the flags as shaddows though.  I think this has a stronger message as we don''t see a countries flag, it could be anyones nation, helping anyone, and not just the US, or Canada, or Uk, or Australia......it removes the National political message for this, and lets the straight Political message hold firm, that Freedom is the basis to Successful nations, whether it is the middle east, or Africa, or anywhere.  A great submission to provoke though, to motivate people, and one that is very different to what I expected, while strongly putting forward a great message........</td>', 'Great words, and something still worth fighting for.......could sit here on my wall. I would have had the writing different, top line ending at the end of the ......., then the second part of the phrase on the second line.  You could afford to shrink the writing to make it work.......Title could have been more bold as well, and the border also I feel should be thicker.... Don''t know what the photo is of, I presume somewhere where the flags of nations fly.  I like the different idea of showing the flags as shaddows though.  I think this has a stronger message as we don''t see a countries flag, it could be anyones nation, helping anyone, and not just the US, or Canada, or Uk, or Australia......it removes the National political message for this, and lets the straight Political message hold firm, that Freedom is the basis to Successful nations, whether it is the middle east, or Africa, or anywhere.  A great submission to provoke though, to motivate people, and one that is very different to what I expected, while strongly putting forward a great message........', '2009-05-13 03:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483400, 789866, 24495, '<td valign="top">Lines drawn with pen are clearly visible. A distraction. 5.</td>', 'Lines drawn with pen are clearly visible. A distraction. 5.', '2009-05-13 03:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483401, 789828, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred to see this presented in the traditional Poster format.  The second line of writing starts to fade into the scene which I am not a fan of, and I also do not like the border you have applied.  The image connects well with the message you have chosen though, but the colouors mean that the hay does not stand out as much as it should.</td>', 'Would have preferred to see this presented in the traditional Poster format.  The second line of writing starts to fade into the scene which I am not a fan of, and I also do not like the border you have applied.  The image connects well with the message you have chosen though, but the colouors mean that the hay does not stand out as much as it should.', '2009-05-13 03:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
