(5484415, 790556, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the text seems a little pale.</td>', 'Great shot, the text seems a little pale.', '2009-05-13 14:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484493, 790429, 52880, '<td valign="top">i liked it! the only thing, I would like to see how the ribbon would look like if  the edges were sharper, crisper. just a though. good joB!</td>', 'i liked it! the only thing, I would like to see how the ribbon would look like if  the edges were sharper, crisper. just a though. good joB!', '2009-05-13 15:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484527, 789866, 16106, '<td valign="top">Ink instead of pencil lines would have been more believable. That said everything else about this image is strong, best in show so far.</td>', 'Ink instead of pencil lines would have been more believable. That said everything else about this image is strong, best in show so far.', '2009-05-13 15:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484532, 790664, 16106, '<td valign="top">This image looks like it belongs in the other challenge. It is a fine image, but it speaks of the warning of past disasters that is not a powerfull motivational tool.</td>', 'This image looks like it belongs in the other challenge. It is a fine image, but it speaks of the warning of past disasters that is not a powerfull motivational tool.', '2009-05-13 15:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484538, 789250, 16106, '<td valign="top">This has a delicacy that I do not associate with the heavy handed graphic style of the motivational poster. It might cost you a vote or two, but if this was on the market, I bet it would sell at least as well as the established aesthetic. Just about perfect.</td>', 'This has a delicacy that I do not associate with the heavy handed graphic style of the motivational poster. It might cost you a vote or two, but if this was on the market, I bet it would sell at least as well as the established aesthetic. Just about perfect.', '2009-05-13 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484543, 790666, 16106, '<td valign="top">Haven''t we seen this fence a few times before? I know that you have done well here, and frankly this is another lovely shot, but how often can you mine the same ground and strike gold?<br/> <br/>That said, a lovely shot with nice detail in the foreground, the only knock is the rather stiff "look at me I''m an airplane" pose of the model. He interrupts a great example of leading lines that reinforce your text.</td>', 'Haven''t we seen this fence a few times before? I know that you have done well here, and frankly this is another lovely shot, but how often can you mine the same ground and strike gold? That said, a lovely shot with nice detail in the foreground, the only knock is the rather stiff "look at me I''m an airplane" pose of the model. He interrupts a great example of leading lines that reinforce your text.', '2009-05-13 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484548, 790757, 16106, '<td valign="top">Poetic, delicate, and subtle. What were you thinking submitting this, such behavior is punished by a mediocre score. What is that I see reflected in that droplet? Is that you Robert?</td>', 'Poetic, delicate, and subtle. What were you thinking submitting this, such behavior is punished by a mediocre score. What is that I see reflected in that droplet? Is that you Robert?', '2009-05-13 16:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484564, 790665, 16106, '<td valign="top">Some quotes are best left unascribed. Nice shot and picking up the yellow of the flower for the text is a nice touch.</td>', 'Some quotes are best left unascribed. Nice shot and picking up the yellow of the flower for the text is a nice touch.', '2009-05-13 16:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484566, 790679, 103958, '<td valign="top">nice capture, great exposure</td>', 'nice capture, great exposure', '2009-05-13 16:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484567, 790689, 16106, '<td valign="top">Why did you not enter this is the other challenge? The bile and bitterness chafes over here, but on the other side, broken dreams are sweet, so very sweet. Well done, both graphically and photographically, but laughing through your tears is the essence of a demotivational poster.</td>', 'Why did you not enter this is the other challenge? The bile and bitterness chafes over here, but on the other side, broken dreams are sweet, so very sweet. Well done, both graphically and photographically, but laughing through your tears is the essence of a demotivational poster.', '2009-05-13 16:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484569, 790144, 103958, '<td valign="top">great perspective.</td>', 'great perspective.', '2009-05-13 16:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5484577, 790751, 103958, '<td valign="top">great image.</td>', 'great image.', '2009-05-13 16:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
