(5484625, 790502, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a very good composition. But it does not go well along with the title, as it seems be indoors. Except if you think that preserving the wildlife should take place in a zoo.</td>', 'It''s a very good composition. But it does not go well along with the title, as it seems be indoors. Except if you think that preserving the wildlife should take place in a zoo.', '2009-05-13 16:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
