(5484658, 789987, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s one of those pictures which immediately grabs the viewer and makes him think, which is quite an exceptional achievement! There''s loads of subtle things happening, the softness, the not quite right perspective, the the lower shadow... Great stuff!</td>', 'It''s one of those pictures which immediately grabs the viewer and makes him think, which is quite an exceptional achievement! There''s loads of subtle things happening, the softness, the not quite right perspective, the the lower shadow... Great stuff!', '2009-05-13 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
