(5486275, 790173, 28322, '<td valign="top">Very well Said, a message well conveyed. I wonder how it will be received in here, thus; I am adding it to my favorites to see how it will do. <br/>Now aside from the Hadith, which is too wonderful to be considered in scoring, and talking only about your photograph: <br/>I find the composition really wonderful and applied to too many occasions, but having dear wife in it, gives the message clearly, <br/>The picture is not as sharp as I would like it to be, can''t blame you much for it in here as we have to downsize it to meet the rules in here. If you think the large version is not sharp enough, then you might need to conceder this. <br/>Now the last thing I don''t like, is the background, it looks too much like the flowers, same tonal range, same colors, same contrast, gives kind of a flat feeling. I''d love it to be a different colors, and some light in it.<br/>This is of course my humble opinion, I hope my comment is taken in a positive way, all the best, 6<br/>Keep up the,</td>', 'Very well Said, a message well conveyed. I wonder how it will be received in here, thus; I am adding it to my favorites to see how it will do. Now aside from the Hadith, which is too wonderful to be considered in scoring, and talking only about your photograph: I find the composition really wonderful and applied to too many occasions, but having dear wife in it, gives the message clearly, The picture is not as sharp as I would like it to be, can''t blame you much for it in here as we have to downsize it to meet the rules in here. If you think the large version is not sharp enough, then you might need to conceder this. Now the last thing I don''t like, is the background, it looks too much like the flowers, same tonal range, same colors, same contrast, gives kind of a flat feeling. I''d love it to be a different colors, and some light in it.This is of course my humble opinion, I hope my comment is taken in a positive way, all the best, 6Keep up the,', '2009-05-14 16:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
