(5487106, 790766, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great use of shaddows in this image.  It creates an effective space for me without being a distraction from the main subject.  It helps the photo rather than having a large plain blue space.  A good idea.<br/> <br/>Nice capture of the flower.  The image is sharp, and the depth of field applied is quite good.  I also like your colour choice for the border and words, as it matches the image very well, and creates a good, finished end product.</td>', 'A great use of shaddows in this image.  It creates an effective space for me without being a distraction from the main subject.  It helps the photo rather than having a large plain blue space.  A good idea. Nice capture of the flower.  The image is sharp, and the depth of field applied is quite good.  I also like your colour choice for the border and words, as it matches the image very well, and creates a good, finished end product.', '2009-05-15 00:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487110, 790355, 96881, '<td valign="top">As you should.  Would have preferred a stronger title/phrase combination that is traditional of motivational posters.  The image you have chosen fits the challenge well, and the capture is very good in mid air.  However the crop lets it down with this.  I feel that you needed more space all around the photo.  The right hand is cropped off, there is no space above the head, and the base is cropped out.  It is like he is jumping out of the page as you have given nowhere to land, no space where he is headed.</td>', 'As you should.  Would have preferred a stronger title/phrase combination that is traditional of motivational posters.  The image you have chosen fits the challenge well, and the capture is very good in mid air.  However the crop lets it down with this.  I feel that you needed more space all around the photo.  The right hand is cropped off, there is no space above the head, and the base is cropped out.  It is like he is jumping out of the page as you have given nowhere to land, no space where he is headed.', '2009-05-15 00:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487112, 790573, 96881, '<td valign="top">The image matches the title and phrase well.  not exactly what i will have on my wall, but the combination works.<br/>Not really sure about your choice of colour for the border, and the white words are very stark when compared to an image of very little white.  Using either the green of the plants, or the blue of his shirt would have fixed this, and tied it closer to the image.</td>', 'The image matches the title and phrase well.  not exactly what i will have on my wall, but the combination works.Not really sure about your choice of colour for the border, and the white words are very stark when compared to an image of very little white.  Using either the green of the plants, or the blue of his shirt would have fixed this, and tied it closer to the image.', '2009-05-15 00:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487114, 790031, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great capture of the flower.  The image is shapr and well contained.  It fits well the title and phrase, and you have used the flower colour for the text, which makes for a proffessional looking poster.</td>', 'A great capture of the flower.  The image is shapr and well contained.  It fits well the title and phrase, and you have used the flower colour for the text, which makes for a proffessional looking poster.', '2009-05-15 00:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487118, 790745, 96881, '<td valign="top">I do not see how this image, especially presented in this way, meets the challenge.  Your narrow depth of field does not work, the focus point makes little sense.  The subject is plain and uninteresting</td>', 'I do not see how this image, especially presented in this way, meets the challenge.  Your narrow depth of field does not work, the focus point makes little sense.  The subject is plain and uninteresting', '2009-05-15 00:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487121, 790174, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, however the subject is very small and therefore hard to see.  Cropping this image close, while removing some of the waves, could have made it better as the subject would be more clearly seen, without losing any of the overall impace of the shot.</td>', 'I like the idea, however the subject is very small and therefore hard to see.  Cropping this image close, while removing some of the waves, could have made it better as the subject would be more clearly seen, without losing any of the overall impace of the shot.', '2009-05-15 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487124, 790659, 96881, '<td valign="top">A really good image and great phrase to go with it.  The water spray is interesting.  Perhaps you could have croppd out some of the foreground as the large area of rocks is not adding much to the image.  Losing an inch off the bottom would remove this large grey area.<br/>interesting choice of colour for the title and words, and ione I don''t think works.  I can''t really see that colour much in the photo.  I would have instead gone with a blue, or the colour of the water, which I think would have matched better.</td>', 'A really good image and great phrase to go with it.  The water spray is interesting.  Perhaps you could have croppd out some of the foreground as the large area of rocks is not adding much to the image.  Losing an inch off the bottom would remove this large grey area.interesting choice of colour for the title and words, and ione I don''t think works.  I can''t really see that colour much in the photo.  I would have instead gone with a blue, or the colour of the water, which I think would have matched better.', '2009-05-15 00:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487125, 790283, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but how does it relate to the Challenge.  The title gives no hints either.  You could have turned this image into a nice motivational poster and possibly scored well, but as it is, there is no connection to the subject........</td>', 'A nice image, but how does it relate to the Challenge.  The title gives no hints either.  You could have turned this image into a nice motivational poster and possibly scored well, but as it is, there is no connection to the subject........', '2009-05-15 00:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487128, 790429, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting submission, and one that does meet the challenge topic for this.  It does take perseverance on this site.  i like the clouds in the sky, but the lack of sharpness is what is hurting you here. it is on the edge where my eyes try and make it sharp, but can''t........its a shame because the idea was good.</td>', 'An interesting submission, and one that does meet the challenge topic for this.  It does take perseverance on this site.  i like the clouds in the sky, but the lack of sharpness is what is hurting you here. it is on the edge where my eyes try and make it sharp, but can''t........its a shame because the idea was good.', '2009-05-15 00:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487129, 790099, 96881, '<td valign="top">nice words, but the crop of the photo is a major problem.  You have cropped too high and that effects the whole result.  having her shoulders in this would have made this a much better submission for this, rather than looking unfinished as it currently does</td>', 'nice words, but the crop of the photo is a major problem.  You have cropped too high and that effects the whole result.  having her shoulders in this would have made this a much better submission for this, rather than looking unfinished as it currently does', '2009-05-15 00:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487130, 790590, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not exactly what i was thinging with the motivation poster challenge.  Sections of the flower are out of focus, and these areas really needed to be sharp to make this work.  A deeper depth of field to ensure this flower was sharp was needed to then make this work.<br/> <br/>I am not a fan of the border, it just doesn''t work for me.<br/> <br/>Also, the top of the flower is cut off by the border, whereas I would prefer to see some dark space above the top of it</td>', 'Not exactly what i was thinging with the motivation poster challenge.  Sections of the flower are out of focus, and these areas really needed to be sharp to make this work.  A deeper depth of field to ensure this flower was sharp was needed to then make this work. I am not a fan of the border, it just doesn''t work for me. Also, the top of the flower is cut off by the border, whereas I would prefer to see some dark space above the top of it', '2009-05-15 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487131, 788970, 96881, '<td valign="top">The  multiple borders around the image are a distraction, and do not work for me.  I like the idea for the image, the refelction of the light on the water though is a problem, and I would prefer the main bird to be goign across rather than away in this case.</td>', 'The  multiple borders around the image are a distraction, and do not work for me.  I like the idea for the image, the refelction of the light on the water though is a problem, and I would prefer the main bird to be goign across rather than away in this case.', '2009-05-15 00:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487133, 790522, 96881, '<td valign="top">I think the phrase is slightly mixed up, but I like the intent of it.  It would have been great if it was on the picture is the normal poster way, as the image matches the phrase very well.  The dog is sharp, and the depth of field for this is very good.</td>', 'I think the phrase is slightly mixed up, but I like the intent of it.  It would have been great if it was on the picture is the normal poster way, as the image matches the phrase very well.  The dog is sharp, and the depth of field for this is very good.', '2009-05-15 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487142, 790383, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the motivational aspect of this image, you have made a statement, but have not motivated me to do anything. The image is quite boring, the angle is interesting but doesn''t really work...........</td>', 'Not sure of the motivational aspect of this image, you have made a statement, but have not motivated me to do anything. The image is quite boring, the angle is interesting but doesn''t really work...........', '2009-05-15 00:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487148, 790144, 96881, '<td valign="top">Can i please suggest a re-edit for this.<br/> <br/>Black background.  Photo up top, red border around it.  Title OPPORTUNITY (in Red) with that phrase below, would make a great motivational poster.  Its just a shame you didn''t take the image and turn it into the challenge submission that it really could have been.  Had you done that, and got the presentation right, this could have been right up there with the top images int he challenge.  The red is terriffic, the open door, the angle.  Probably the only problem is the dark rectangle above the door.  Still good marks, but this could have really been stunning with the correct presentation</td>', 'Can i please suggest a re-edit for this. Black background.  Photo up top, red border around it.  Title OPPORTUNITY (in Red) with that phrase below, would make a great motivational poster.  Its just a shame you didn''t take the image and turn it into the challenge submission that it really could have been.  Had you done that, and got the presentation right, this could have been right up there with the top images int he challenge.  The red is terriffic, the open door, the angle.  Probably the only problem is the dark rectangle above the door.  Still good marks, but this could have really been stunning with the correct presentation', '2009-05-15 00:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487150, 790666, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great.  Presentation is good, the image is good, the overall submission works.<br/>Shame about the low cloud though, as it means the contrast of the person against the sky is lost somewhat.  Having the clear image against the bright sky would have made this better, as at the moment, it does blend a little which loses the effect.</td>', 'Great.  Presentation is good, the image is good, the overall submission works.Shame about the low cloud though, as it means the contrast of the person against the sky is lost somewhat.  Having the clear image against the bright sky would have made this better, as at the moment, it does blend a little which loses the effect.', '2009-05-15 00:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487154, 790667, 96881, '<td valign="top">A simple, yet effective image, that works well for this challenge.  The colours are great, the overall combination works.  Maybe a title (Ambition) could have added to the overall effect.</td>', 'A simple, yet effective image, that works well for this challenge.  The colours are great, the overall combination works.  Maybe a title (Ambition) could have added to the overall effect.', '2009-05-15 00:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487170, 789073, 106684, '<td valign="top">I like the phrase. To stay active all the time. I think you tried to focus both the flower and the bee at the same time.</td>', 'I like the phrase. To stay active all the time. I think you tried to focus both the flower and the bee at the same time.', '2009-05-15 01:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487175, 790743, 106684, '<td valign="top">Wow! Excellent Photography, in-depth details. I like the color contrast that is handled naturally. I amaze to think that the photographer had taken enough risks to shoot this picture. very neat!</td>', 'Wow! Excellent Photography, in-depth details. I like the color contrast that is handled naturally. I amaze to think that the photographer had taken enough risks to shoot this picture. very neat!', '2009-05-15 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487176, 790526, 106684, '<td valign="top">Looks good.</td>', 'Looks good.', '2009-05-15 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487179, 790449, 106684, '<td valign="top">Excellent motivational phrase.</td>', 'Excellent motivational phrase.', '2009-05-15 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487180, 790204, 106684, '<td valign="top">It would be better if the dog face is turned this side.</td>', 'It would be better if the dog face is turned this side.', '2009-05-15 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487183, 790767, 106684, '<td valign="top">I like the photography as well as the phrase.</td>', 'I like the photography as well as the phrase.', '2009-05-15 01:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487186, 789872, 106684, '<td valign="top">simple and neat.</td>', 'simple and neat.', '2009-05-15 01:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487188, 790596, 106684, '<td valign="top">Good phrase.</td>', 'Good phrase.', '2009-05-15 01:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487189, 790598, 106684, '<td valign="top">Wow! love it.</td>', 'Wow! love it.', '2009-05-15 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487201, 790505, 48471, '<td valign="top">So true.</td>', 'So true.', '2009-05-15 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487245, 790174, 48471, '<td valign="top">'' !</td>', ''' !', '2009-05-15 02:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487339, 790663, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the saying, very fitting of a motivational poster.  I find the lighting to be very effective, it illustrates the day we are talking about, and as a result, works well.  I know that an elephant like that is meant to be good luck, but I am not sure it is adding terrifically to the image in this case.  it is pointing to the day (a positive) but the lighting and shadows makes me think then he is a bit of an afterthought.  but having said that, without him, maybe the image wouold be a little too plain.  So maybe some better lighting, or a different position could have been better.  White border in this case was right, not sure of the yellow colour of the phrase though, as that colour doesn''t appear in the rest of the photo......</td>', 'I like the saying, very fitting of a motivational poster.  I find the lighting to be very effective, it illustrates the day we are talking about, and as a result, works well.  I know that an elephant like that is meant to be good luck, but I am not sure it is adding terrifically to the image in this case.  it is pointing to the day (a positive) but the lighting and shadows makes me think then he is a bit of an afterthought.  but having said that, without him, maybe the image wouold be a little too plain.  So maybe some better lighting, or a different position could have been better.  White border in this case was right, not sure of the yellow colour of the phrase though, as that colour doesn''t appear in the rest of the photo......', '2009-05-15 03:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487340, 790122, 96881, '<td valign="top">A greta image and a good saying.  in this case, i think it works that you have chosen a different layout to typical motivational posters.  The colours in the image are very good, interesting without being overpowering, so very fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'A greta image and a good saying.  in this case, i think it works that you have chosen a different layout to typical motivational posters.  The colours in the image are very good, interesting without being overpowering, so very fitting for the challenge.', '2009-05-15 03:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487341, 790765, 96881, '<td valign="top">yes, Diversity what........where is the motivational saying that makes this a motivational poster, rather than a statement.  The image you have chosen does connect in well with the title.  The colours are very bright and different.  I don''t know what this is that you photographed.  Its just a shame it is not more closely linked to the challenge, as that will hurt your overall score</td>', 'yes, Diversity what........where is the motivational saying that makes this a motivational poster, rather than a statement.  The image you have chosen does connect in well with the title.  The colours are very bright and different.  I don''t know what this is that you photographed.  Its just a shame it is not more closely linked to the challenge, as that will hurt your overall score', '2009-05-15 03:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487343, 790534, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the image, except that I would love to remove the lower flower from it.  The two flowers facing out are great, cutting the other off would have added to this in my opinion.  It would then have allowed the image to move further down, away from the top of the photo and away from feeling that the leaf is almost cut off.  Apart from that, it is a great capture, and the title/saaying do match exceptionally well</td>', 'I like the image, except that I would love to remove the lower flower from it.  The two flowers facing out are great, cutting the other off would have added to this in my opinion.  It would then have allowed the image to move further down, away from the top of the photo and away from feeling that the leaf is almost cut off.  Apart from that, it is a great capture, and the title/saaying do match exceptionally well', '2009-05-15 03:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487344, 790503, 96881, '<td valign="top">Ducky''s, and very effective.  A good image to match the title and saying, which ties the who poster together.  The spots on the ground on the right however are a problem, and a shame you couldn''t clean it up under this editing ruleset.  The light is a little harsh maybe.  I understand having it come from that direction, and like the shadows that will create, but the chest/top of head areas are a little too bright in my opinion......</td>', 'Ducky''s, and very effective.  A good image to match the title and saying, which ties the who poster together.  The spots on the ground on the right however are a problem, and a shame you couldn''t clean it up under this editing ruleset.  The light is a little harsh maybe.  I understand having it come from that direction, and like the shadows that will create, but the chest/top of head areas are a little too bright in my opinion......', '2009-05-15 03:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487345, 790408, 96881, '<td valign="top">The image works well with the saying.  however you needed to have a larger area at the bottom so that the text does not sit over the image.  For me, the writing and the lower lights are fighting, and it doesn''t work.  Also, I would prefer the words to be centre aligned, and not to the left.<br/>The colour in the city is good, the crane is perfect for this, adds to the image and makes the statement.  I like the image and the processing you have done, the exposure is good.  With changes to the presentation, this could have been a very high scoring submission</td>', 'The image works well with the saying.  however you needed to have a larger area at the bottom so that the text does not sit over the image.  For me, the writing and the lower lights are fighting, and it doesn''t work.  Also, I would prefer the words to be centre aligned, and not to the left.The colour in the city is good, the crane is perfect for this, adds to the image and makes the statement.  I like the image and the processing you have done, the exposure is good.  With changes to the presentation, this could have been a very high scoring submission', '2009-05-15 03:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487347, 789866, 96881, '<td valign="top">Brilliant Title, Saying and photo combination.  They all compliment each other, and all work together to make a very good submission<br/>The lighting is probably the largest concern here.  The top of the egg is starting to be blown out, and yet i feel the need for a little more light on the two clamps, just to make them stand out a little more from the background.  The only other thing is the areas int he very lower part of the photo, which add nothing, so removing them would have also been a plus.  Still, a reall good submission.</td>', 'Brilliant Title, Saying and photo combination.  They all compliment each other, and all work together to make a very good submissionThe lighting is probably the largest concern here.  The top of the egg is starting to be blown out, and yet i feel the need for a little more light on the two clamps, just to make them stand out a little more from the background.  The only other thing is the areas int he very lower part of the photo, which add nothing, so removing them would have also been a plus.  Still, a reall good submission.', '2009-05-15 04:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487348, 790556, 96881, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Not presented int eh normla motivational poster way, but doesn''t need to be.  The phrase is perfect, the image is very good, the exposure is spot on, just getting the glint off the boats, being able to see details, but them still being dark.  A really good submission that has little to fault.</td>', 'Stunning.  Not presented int eh normla motivational poster way, but doesn''t need to be.  The phrase is perfect, the image is very good, the exposure is spot on, just getting the glint off the boats, being able to see details, but them still being dark.  A really good submission that has little to fault.', '2009-05-15 04:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487350, 790733, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the saying, an interesting idea with the title, but maybe the crop could be improved, so that the lower face is in the picture a little more, rather than being cropped out, especailly cropping out the lower part of the smile.  Including this area below would have made this look more complete than it does at the moment.</td>', 'I like the saying, an interesting idea with the title, but maybe the crop could be improved, so that the lower face is in the picture a little more, rather than being cropped out, especailly cropping out the lower part of the smile.  Including this area below would have made this look more complete than it does at the moment.', '2009-05-15 04:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487381, 789741, 83544, '<td valign="top">The quality of the font is terrible, it ruins a perfect photo</td>', 'The quality of the font is terrible, it ruins a perfect photo', '2009-05-15 05:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
