(5487948, 789151, 71886, '<td valign="top">The centered composition doesn''t do it for me.  The blown out highlights on the bottom petal are distracting.  I love the bokeh though.</td>', 'The centered composition doesn''t do it for me.  The blown out highlights on the bottom petal are distracting.  I love the bokeh though.', '2009-05-15 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487959, 790094, 71886, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  To me this photo is suffering from the basic editing size limitations.  I like the border, but it is so large thus making the actual size of the image rather small.  This makes it hard to see the true detail of the scene.  The bright sky in the top left is a little distracting to me, but I know the exposure had to be long enough to get the detail out in the shadows of the trees.  Its a beautiful photo and it would be nice to see it at a larger size.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  To me this photo is suffering from the basic editing size limitations.  I like the border, but it is so large thus making the actual size of the image rather small.  This makes it hard to see the true detail of the scene.  The bright sky in the top left is a little distracting to me, but I know the exposure had to be long enough to get the detail out in the shadows of the trees.  Its a beautiful photo and it would be nice to see it at a larger size.', '2009-05-15 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5487962, 790099, 71886, '<td valign="top">I like your idea a lot.  I think it is a little over-exposed.  I would also like to have seen the composition altered so the tree isn''t in the bottom right.</td>', 'I like your idea a lot.  I think it is a little over-exposed.  I would also like to have seen the composition altered so the tree isn''t in the bottom right.', '2009-05-15 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
