(5492588, 790006, 28322, '<td valign="top">My Previous comment was inappropriate, I apologize, <br/>I''ll give it another try: <br/> <br/>Composition is kind of flat in here, nothing to be considered the center of the attention, I think it would be improved if we for example removed the cars, the girl sat on the platform, included the boats without all the distracting objects that surround them, this might higher the score of this image to 5, if we chose the right moment to shoot it, lets say sunset or sunrise, this might raise the score to 6-7, the last this to deal with is the low resolution, it is either low resolution camera, or lots of noise, <br/>If the problem was the camera, I can''t help with that, but if it is only noise related to ISO, I would suggest using NeatImage.com software, it is free and remove the noise, but overusing it might make the capture looks soft.  <br/>I''d say planing a shot has to be your first friend in here. <br/>This is my humble opinion. I apologize for the rude comment I left before. If you still need any explanation on my current comment, please PM, you are most welcome, <br/>Best of luck and keep shooting,</td>', 'My Previous comment was inappropriate, I apologize, I''ll give it another try:  Composition is kind of flat in here, nothing to be considered the center of the attention, I think it would be improved if we for example removed the cars, the girl sat on the platform, included the boats without all the distracting objects that surround them, this might higher the score of this image to 5, if we chose the right moment to shoot it, lets say sunset or sunrise, this might raise the score to 6-7, the last this to deal with is the low resolution, it is either low resolution camera, or lots of noise, If the problem was the camera, I can''t help with that, but if it is only noise related to ISO, I would suggest using NeatImage.com software, it is free and remove the noise, but overusing it might make the capture looks soft.  I''d say planing a shot has to be your first friend in here. This is my humble opinion. I apologize for the rude comment I left before. If you still need any explanation on my current comment, please PM, you are most welcome, Best of luck and keep shooting,', '2009-05-19 16:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
