(5493076, 790737, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image, and an interesting composition, that does work well with the title and phrase you have chosen to put with it.  The colours are vibrant and really good, maybe the crop ont he right should have had all the end girl in the photo, but overall a very good end product.</td>', 'A very interesting image, and an interesting composition, that does work well with the title and phrase you have chosen to put with it.  The colours are vibrant and really good, maybe the crop ont he right should have had all the end girl in the photo, but overall a very good end product.', '2009-05-20 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493077, 790005, 31534, '<td valign="top">I like view.</td>', 'I like view.', '2009-05-20 00:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493080, 790281, 83313, '<td valign="top">Speaking of big, that crosswalk does indeed make a nice, big target.</td>', 'Speaking of big, that crosswalk does indeed make a nice, big target.', '2009-05-20 00:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493083, 790598, 96881, '<td valign="top">The phrase fits the image really well, but is not inspiring me to do anything.  The sky in the photo is huge, made even more so by the crop at the bottom with a litmited foreground, yet the entire image lacks a focal point, which is effective for the phrase, but doesn''t really leave a lasting impression.</td>', 'The phrase fits the image really well, but is not inspiring me to do anything.  The sky in the photo is huge, made even more so by the crop at the bottom with a litmited foreground, yet the entire image lacks a focal point, which is effective for the phrase, but doesn''t really leave a lasting impression.', '2009-05-20 00:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493085, 790595, 96881, '<td valign="top">A little extra attention to the overall presentation of the poster would have made this.  Arms looks awkward being on the second line by itself.  Whanging the font size to put this on one line, or breaking the line after the comma would have helped.<br/>Not really sure on the crop, the cutting off the top of his head looks more accidental than artistic.  Including the top of his head and some additionals pace would have helped on that</td>', 'A little extra attention to the overall presentation of the poster would have made this.  Arms looks awkward being on the second line by itself.  Whanging the font size to put this on one line, or breaking the line after the comma would have helped.Not really sure on the crop, the cutting off the top of his head looks more accidental than artistic.  Including the top of his head and some additionals pace would have helped on that', '2009-05-20 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493086, 790233, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very dark image, but one with a strong theme, which is very well conveyed by this.  For some reason, this overall composition works well, and stands out by being different and yet effective.</td>', 'A very dark image, but one with a strong theme, which is very well conveyed by this.  For some reason, this overall composition works well, and stands out by being different and yet effective.', '2009-05-20 00:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493088, 790505, 96881, '<td valign="top">The atifacts, both in the black background, and on the watch, are a distraction to the overall image.  A good choice of phrase, but by the centred subject, and the crop, the image doesn''t really appeal.  Taking this on an angle, or something, might have apealled stronger.</td>', 'The atifacts, both in the black background, and on the watch, are a distraction to the overall image.  A good choice of phrase, but by the centred subject, and the crop, the image doesn''t really appeal.  Taking this on an angle, or something, might have apealled stronger.', '2009-05-20 00:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493090, 790034, 96881, '<td valign="top">A phrase I really like and one that is very inspirational.<br/>However, the lighting of this doesn''t really seem to work for me.  I like the idea of what you have done, yet the end product for me is that the plant in the water looks fake, and like it was introduced later.  I feel it is too bright, and the lighting needed to be much more subtle to pull this off and make an effective overall impression</td>', 'A phrase I really like and one that is very inspirational.However, the lighting of this doesn''t really seem to work for me.  I like the idea of what you have done, yet the end product for me is that the plant in the water looks fake, and like it was introduced later.  I feel it is too bright, and the lighting needed to be much more subtle to pull this off and make an effective overall impression', '2009-05-20 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493091, 789928, 96881, '<td valign="top">The tight crop is very restrictive of this image, and the dappled lighting is a big distraction.  There are many dark areas in the vehicle, and the light areas int eh background draw attention away from the subject</td>', 'The tight crop is very restrictive of this image, and the dappled lighting is a big distraction.  There are many dark areas in the vehicle, and the light areas int eh background draw attention away from the subject', '2009-05-20 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493092, 789151, 96881, '<td valign="top">The lighting of this is a little harsh, and the very centred composition doesn''t really work for me.  Depth of field applied to this image to remove background distractions is very good.</td>', 'The lighting of this is a little harsh, and the very centred composition doesn''t really work for me.  Depth of field applied to this image to remove background distractions is very good.', '2009-05-20 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493093, 790136, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, and a nice scene, however I am not sure about the square crop.  A typical landscape crop may have worked better for this, giving the feel that we are seeing the entire vista</td>', 'Nice colours, and a nice scene, however I am not sure about the square crop.  A typical landscape crop may have worked better for this, giving the feel that we are seeing the entire vista', '2009-05-20 00:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493095, 789951, 96881, '<td valign="top">The strong backlighting, causing the pale washed out look of the tree in the upper areas of the shot is a negative.  I would have liked the tree to be strong and black the entire length of the shot.</td>', 'The strong backlighting, causing the pale washed out look of the tree in the upper areas of the shot is a negative.  I would have liked the tree to be strong and black the entire length of the shot.', '2009-05-20 00:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493096, 790596, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not really the motivational poster type.  The depth of field means the eyes and face are the subject, which ties in well to your phrase, but means the overall image doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Not really the motivational poster type.  The depth of field means the eyes and face are the subject, which ties in well to your phrase, but means the overall image doesn''t appeal to me.', '2009-05-20 00:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493098, 790502, 96881, '<td valign="top">A good statement made and really good presentation of the overall poster.  The entire composition works to expressed your message in a very effective way</td>', 'A good statement made and really good presentation of the overall poster.  The entire composition works to expressed your message in a very effective way', '2009-05-20 00:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493101, 790173, 96881, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is what makes it.  By the placement of the elements, where you have cropped etc, has turned what could have been a boring flower shot into a very interesting omage that works very well.  The attention to the overall poster presentation gives it a finished feel and helps tie it in really well to the challenge.</td>', 'The composition of this photo is what makes it.  By the placement of the elements, where you have cropped etc, has turned what could have been a boring flower shot into a very interesting omage that works very well.  The attention to the overall poster presentation gives it a finished feel and helps tie it in really well to the challenge.', '2009-05-20 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493102, 790589, 96881, '<td valign="top">There are a number of artifacts, especailly around the words, but in other places, that detracts from the photo.  I find the composition a little boring.  Teh colours through throughout the image are nice and vivid</td>', 'There are a number of artifacts, especailly around the words, but in other places, that detracts from the photo.  I find the composition a little boring.  Teh colours through throughout the image are nice and vivid', '2009-05-20 00:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493104, 790646, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very clean image, well supported by a great blue sky.  composition of this is very good, adn the overall presenttaion of the poster looks professional and is well executed.  A great clean image that matched the title and phrase chosen very well</td>', 'A very clean image, well supported by a great blue sky.  composition of this is very good, adn the overall presenttaion of the poster looks professional and is well executed.  A great clean image that matched the title and phrase chosen very well', '2009-05-20 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493111, 789511, 96881, '<td valign="top">Cropping off the aircraft wings for me in this image makes it seem a little incomplete.  The darkness of the underside of the wings also create large, black areas, whereas some fill light would have shown these with some detail which would have made this photo.  Some additional foreground with the names on the wall, giving this more prominance, would have then made the names of the fallen the clear subject of the photo, and therefore made a stronger statement overall.<br/>The title and phrase do tie in really well with the photo, and with the changes mentioned above, this could then have been one of my highest rated photos in the challenge</td>', 'Cropping off the aircraft wings for me in this image makes it seem a little incomplete.  The darkness of the underside of the wings also create large, black areas, whereas some fill light would have shown these with some detail which would have made this photo.  Some additional foreground with the names on the wall, giving this more prominance, would have then made the names of the fallen the clear subject of the photo, and therefore made a stronger statement overall.The title and phrase do tie in really well with the photo, and with the changes mentioned above, this could then have been one of my highest rated photos in the challenge', '2009-05-20 00:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493117, 788931, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, by its composition you have made it much more than just a picture of a girl, and that is what makes this image a lot more appealing.  it ties in well with the phrase, with her seemingly looking off into the future, one that is uncertain, but one that she will create as she grows.  A great image and a good submission.</td>', 'An interesting image, by its composition you have made it much more than just a picture of a girl, and that is what makes this image a lot more appealing.  it ties in well with the phrase, with her seemingly looking off into the future, one that is uncertain, but one that she will create as she grows.  A great image and a good submission.', '2009-05-20 00:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
