(5493123, 790743, 96881, '<td valign="top">I think this should have been in the other challenge.  With that phrase on it, it belongs in the de-motivational challenge, where I feel it would have done much better than it is here.  I find the overall image is too light, there are no real dark colours in this.  Darkening this image would have impresed it significantly</td>', 'I think this should have been in the other challenge.  With that phrase on it, it belongs in the de-motivational challenge, where I feel it would have done much better than it is here.  I find the overall image is too light, there are no real dark colours in this.  Darkening this image would have impresed it significantly', '2009-05-20 00:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493127, 790757, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the image, I like the phrase, I like the overall concept and message you are trying to portray, but don''t find it really to be that motivational.  A little extyra room around the sides and top of this image, just to clearly define that nothing is cropped off, would have helped this slightly as well.  it feels a little contrained by the current crop</td>', 'I like the image, I like the phrase, I like the overall concept and message you are trying to portray, but don''t find it really to be that motivational.  A little extyra room around the sides and top of this image, just to clearly define that nothing is cropped off, would have helped this slightly as well.  it feels a little contrained by the current crop', '2009-05-20 00:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5493129, 790463, 96881, '<td valign="top">The last image to vote on and comment............<br/>Great overall poster composition.  I think that you got the overall presentation spot on, the colours and text right, and avoiding the overall black border in thsi case works really well for me.<br/>Maybe a little extra diffused light onto his face, just to avoid the dark eyes that you have here, may have worked.  But hey, overall, an image that fits in exceptionally well with the title and phrase you have chosen, and a really good overall submission.</td>', 'The last image to vote on and comment............Great overall poster composition.  I think that you got the overall presentation spot on, the colours and text right, and avoiding the overall black border in thsi case works really well for me.Maybe a little extra diffused light onto his face, just to avoid the dark eyes that you have here, may have worked.  But hey, overall, an image that fits in exceptionally well with the title and phrase you have chosen, and a really good overall submission.', '2009-05-20 00:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
