(5493293, 790429, 106233, '<td valign="top">The edges aren´t sharp, indeed.<br/> <br/>I knew it. But the original template (a paper sheet cutted with the ribbon shape) was not perfectly cutted, and the pictures with the focus in it were not good. It was monday, and the next day the sky were very grey and cloudy...<br/> <br/>I tried to fix it with Unsharp Mask... but no big progress at all.<br/> <br/>I was very upset about it, because i thought that this was a nice idea, and the unsharpness was a big issue... (and this was the oppinion of most of the commenters...)<br/> <br/>Anyway...<br/> <br/>Lets persevere until the victory!!</td>', 'The edges aren´t sharp, indeed. I knew it. But the original template (a paper sheet cutted with the ribbon shape) was not perfectly cutted, and the pictures with the focus in it were not good. It was monday, and the next day the sky were very grey and cloudy... I tried to fix it with Unsharp Mask... but no big progress at all. I was very upset about it, because i thought that this was a nice idea, and the unsharpness was a big issue... (and this was the oppinion of most of the commenters...) Anyway... Lets persevere until the victory!!', '2009-05-20 01:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493299, 790340, 79955, '<td valign="top">No surprise here Karen !!!! Congrats on a fabulous shot.</td>', 'No surprise here Karen !!!! Congrats on a fabulous shot.', '2009-05-20 01:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
