(5493331, 790340, 102811, '<td valign="top">Stunning image and score. Really well done. I''m honoured to be sharing the virtual podium with you.</td>', 'Stunning image and score. Really well done. I''m honoured to be sharing the virtual podium with you.', '2009-05-20 02:25:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493333, 790006, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was right about whose entry this was. Congrats on another addition to your collection. You are the master of the brown!</td>', 'I was right about whose entry this was. Congrats on another addition to your collection. You are the master of the brown!', '2009-05-20 02:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493339, 790410, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really like the sentiment behind this one, and it is good to read the back story, too.  The people are clearly all in the second half of their lives, and clearly having a whale of a time!  From a photographic perspective it would have been good if one of the men had been turned a little more towards the camera, but you still got your message across well.</td>', 'I really like the sentiment behind this one, and it is good to read the back story, too.  The people are clearly all in the second half of their lives, and clearly having a whale of a time!  From a photographic perspective it would have been good if one of the men had been turned a little more towards the camera, but you still got your message across well.', '2009-05-20 02:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493341, 790589, 83313, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC, hope the harshness of your first challenge did not discourage you too much. That would really stink for the motivational poster challenge to demotivate someone, so keep trying or I will feel bad. You don''t want me feeling bad and blubbering all over the forums. Slippy teases me when that happens. <br/> <br/>The nice thing is, when you nail a good shot, and everyone wows over it, you know it is <b>not</b> false praise.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC, hope the harshness of your first challenge did not discourage you too much. That would really stink for the motivational poster challenge to demotivate someone, so keep trying or I will feel bad. You don''t want me feeling bad and blubbering all over the forums. Slippy teases me when that happens.  The nice thing is, when you nail a good shot, and everyone wows over it, you know it is not false praise.', '2009-05-20 02:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493346, 788931, 67258, '<td valign="top">I remember viewing this during voting, and smiling - I am sure it is infectious! Is this Bug?  There is something about her gaze, her smile, that shows a real uniqueness of spirit - lovely.</td>', 'I remember viewing this during voting, and smiling - I am sure it is infectious! Is this Bug?  There is something about her gaze, her smile, that shows a real uniqueness of spirit - lovely.', '2009-05-20 02:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493347, 790722, 67258, '<td valign="top">Do you know, I only gave this a 5 during voting.  I wish I could go back and change that, because you are right, it is motivating, and has given me a lift this morning with a new day ahead of me (and the sun is shining here for the first time in nearly a week!)</td>', 'Do you know, I only gave this a 5 during voting.  I wish I could go back and change that, because you are right, it is motivating, and has given me a lift this morning with a new day ahead of me (and the sun is shining here for the first time in nearly a week!)', '2009-05-20 02:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493349, 790757, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautifully presented, beautifully photographed, and one of my favourite poems - I hoped this would finish in the top 5.</td>', 'Beautifully presented, beautifully photographed, and one of my favourite poems - I hoped this would finish in the top 5.', '2009-05-20 02:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493354, 790737, 67258, '<td valign="top">You have captured the curiosity of the children well, and wonderful interaction between those in the group.  The solitary child off to the left makes me feel rather sad; I am sure he isn''t really cast out, just passing by, but that was the emotion that was evoked in me on first viewing.  A cool idea for a poster, and a text that has clearly been inspired by the photo.</td>', 'You have captured the curiosity of the children well, and wonderful interaction between those in the group.  The solitary child off to the left makes me feel rather sad; I am sure he isn''t really cast out, just passing by, but that was the emotion that was evoked in me on first viewing.  A cool idea for a poster, and a text that has clearly been inspired by the photo.', '2009-05-20 02:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493355, 790340, 33068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love the colors!  May I ask you lit this?</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love the colors!  May I ask you lit this?', '2009-05-20 02:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493363, 790340, 31637, '<td valign="top">Im so glad this photo won a ribbon, I didn''t vote in the challenge and would have been sorry if I missed this! Complimentary colors and their placement in the frame really make it!Congratulations on your success:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-20 01:47:53.</i></td>', 'Im so glad this photo won a ribbon, I didn''t vote in the challenge and would have been sorry if I missed this! Complimentary colors and their placement in the frame really make it!Congratulations on your success:)', '2009-05-20 02:46:31.000000', '2009-05-20 02:47:53.000000', 0),
(5493364, 790031, 67258, '<td valign="top">It''s wonderful to see you entering challenges again; this must have been one of the best Mother''s Day presents ever - the inspiration to pick up your camera after such a long hiatus.  Peter, we at DPC owe you one mate!</td>', 'It''s wonderful to see you entering challenges again; this must have been one of the best Mother''s Day presents ever - the inspiration to pick up your camera after such a long hiatus.  Peter, we at DPC owe you one mate!', '2009-05-20 02:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493367, 790595, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten and the new personal best!  And welcome back to the guys and gals.</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten and the new personal best!  And welcome back to the guys and gals.', '2009-05-20 02:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493373, 790598, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am ashamed and appalled to see that I gave this a 4.  I don''t understand, as the photo is strong, and the quote motivating.  I remember thinking when viewing it that I was on the negative side of ambivalence regarding the font, and that I wished the tide-smoothed sand extended right to the left, but those are nit-picks.  All I can claim is a moments insanity (or I pressed the wrong button) - can I be forgiven, Bear?....</td>', 'I am ashamed and appalled to see that I gave this a 4.  I don''t understand, as the photo is strong, and the quote motivating.  I remember thinking when viewing it that I was on the negative side of ambivalence regarding the font, and that I wished the tide-smoothed sand extended right to the left, but those are nit-picks.  All I can claim is a moments insanity (or I pressed the wrong button) - can I be forgiven, Bear?....', '2009-05-20 02:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493378, 790144, 67258, '<td valign="top">I scored this down because of the lack of text.  On this viewing, though, I can see the photos message so clearly - and it doesn''t need a text to inspire and motivate; it speaks for itself.  Have you thought about re-editting the photo without the constraints of basic editting and correcting the perspective?  I think it would be really strong then.</td>', 'I scored this down because of the lack of text.  On this viewing, though, I can see the photos message so clearly - and it doesn''t need a text to inspire and motivate; it speaks for itself.  Have you thought about re-editting the photo without the constraints of basic editting and correcting the perspective?  I think it would be really strong then.', '2009-05-20 02:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493380, 790751, 67258, '<td valign="top">This one definitely me makes me laugh - I''d love to know the story of how the rock came to be in the truck, and was it placed there before or after the truck gave up the ghost....  Well presented.</td>', 'This one definitely me makes me laugh - I''d love to know the story of how the rock came to be in the truck, and was it placed there before or after the truck gave up the ghost....  Well presented.', '2009-05-20 02:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
