(5493689, 789821, 93565, '<td valign="top">I would agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paynekj</a> that the text color isn''t very appealing. I also don''t really see any visual connection to persistency in the subject matter. For me, these posters generally have a small correlation to subject matter, but I see very little in this.<br/>A more interesting font would have helped as well.<br/>It also sorta feels like the waterfall is cropped a bit close for my taste.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-05-20 07:13:29.</i></td>', 'I would agree with  paynekj that the text color isn''t very appealing. I also don''t really see any visual connection to persistency in the subject matter. For me, these posters generally have a small correlation to subject matter, but I see very little in this.A more interesting font would have helped as well.It also sorta feels like the waterfall is cropped a bit close for my taste.', '2009-05-20 08:07:23.000000', '2009-05-20 08:13:29.000000', 0),
